ACCESS

The physical device used in the underlying research is NOT provided with this package and
is not required to evaluate it.

No remote access to any device is provided or required, because operational artifacts
(live network addresses, credentials, session material, exact endpoints and payloads) are
deliberately withheld from this public package — see artifact/WITHHELD-ARTIFACTS.md.

All claims in claims/ are evaluated by static inspection of sanitized data files included in
this package. No claim script attempts to contact a device, network, or vendor service.
